  "answer": "This has been reported before (PowerToys#43408). Self-elevating apps such as HWiNFO show the UAC prompt when launched from Command Palette, but nothing happens after you click Yes. The cause is that some apps cannot be elevated from an unelevated WinUI3 process, and the failure comes after the first UAC dialog. The ticket shows no released fix, only a proposed workaround of using a trusted helper such as sudo to launch the app. Until then, launch these apps from the Start Menu, where they work. In HWiNFO's case, one reporter found that two entries appeared in Command Palette and only one of them worked. Try the other entry if you see more than one."
 },
